00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.940
It was when I was in the third grade of elementary school.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:21.040
I thought that a plane was a good thing.

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:22.820
I thought it would be a great thing in the future.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.600
