00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:46.200
I went to Chochin.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:47.380
I got it from Chochin.

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:49.900
That's how I made it.

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:54.640
My dream was to be the best when I was in 6th grade.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.760
I thought I would fly to Tokyo, but I was the opposite.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.040
My mother and my relatives were in Shizuoka.

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.740
Shizuoka was the only place I could go.

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:08.220
I was the opposite.

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:10.130
I thought I was born to be a real man.

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:14.680
I was born to be a real man.

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:15.480
I was born to be a real man.

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:19.370
I was forced to go to a different school.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:21.280
I wanted to go to a different school.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:24.350
I was told that if I had money to go to a different school, I would be able to fly.

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:26.090
I was beaten up.

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.470
I was beaten up a lot.

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:28.870
Thank you for watching.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:31.200
I learned from my parents.

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:36.790
Anyway, flying is like being a driver.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.430
It's important to make a plane.

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:43.090
I learned how to make a plane first, then I learned how to fly it.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:45.910
Was this plane like that in your childhood?

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.440
I don't know anything about food.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:51.440
I don't know anything about food.

