00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:42.860
But at that time, only the amateurs gathered to shoot.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:44.980
That's why it wasn't so interesting.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:49.440
So I wanted to use the actors of the businessmen and shoot properly.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:52.040
That's why it's so famous.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:56.680
So your father's dream is now Akira-chan.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:57.820
Yes.

00:08:59.140 --> 00:08:59.860
Akira-chan.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.780
I'll make it with my own hands.

