00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:27.520
But now it's time to accept it.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.680
I can make a monster like you guys.

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:37.420
Should we scare people who are watching us?

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.660
Or should we get familiar with them?

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:41.710
I don't think it's enough just to scare them.

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:46.650
There has to be something humorous in the monster.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.460
I'm getting tired of what's going to happen.

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:56.230
In the future, the monster has to have its own personality.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.920
I think it's important to have a character that fits the costume.

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:09.980
I think it's important to have a character that fits the costume.

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:12.850
I see.

