You don't think about such things easily, do you?

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:09.800
I don't put people in. I just reduce the number of people.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.980
I don't put people in. I ask them to do it.

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:13.540
I don't think the company is a bad company.

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:15.200
I think you're thinking that you can do it.

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.480
You're doing your best in this state, aren't you?

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.820
