I can do it if I am prepared.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:41.120
If I am well prepared,

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.140
If my work is well done,

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:45.750
I can do it if I am in the right way.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:51.750
If I am in the right way, then I can do it.

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:29.010
Realism is at its peak.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:42.490
I think Tsuburaya-kun had the passion and skill to create such a world of art and to use various technologies to bring out special effects in the world of Japanese cinema that no one had even considered as a problem.

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:47.460
I wanted to open up a new world for Japanese filmmakers.

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:52.550
Tsuburaya-kun had the passion and the skills to do so.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.960
This is one of the ways for me to make Japanese films.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:04.060
That's why I think Matsuburaya-san and I have the same opinion.

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:25.550
When I look around, I see Godzilla rampaging around and destroying cities.

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:29.940
